    "L6_top_supported_1": "Because in the same country, on the same calendar, in the same year, there is a population doing the inverse: **doubling every twenty years, retaining 85 to 97 percent of its youth, and accumulating capital fast enough that its primary bank crossed $1.5 billion in assets in 2024.** The current state of American coherence is not a single number.",
